{"id":615165,"imdb":"tt10981202","en":"Her Blue Sky","orig":"空の青さを知る人よ","ar":null,"tag":null,"ov":"High school student Aoi Aioi lives with her elder sister, Akane, after a tragic accident took their parents away 13 years ago. Because Akane has since been taking care of her single-handedly, Aoi wants to move to Tokyo after her graduation to relieve her sister's burden and pursue a musical career, inspired by Akane's ex-boyfriend Shinnosuke \"Shinno\" Kanamuro. Shinno was part of a band until he left for Tokyo to become a professional guitarist after the sisters' parents passed away, and he was never to be seen again.","rd":"2019-10-11","rt":108,"g":[16,10749],"lang":"ja","budget":0,"revenue":4736031,"companies":[{"n":"CloverWorks","logo":"/kZvTniBgpTzAThHCa0OZ1FJtRjy.png","c":"JP"},{"n":"Aniplex","logo":"/rDYExnBV61jGQnkhVVrPN4Yl7O1.png","c":"JP"},{"n":"Fuji Television Network","logo":"/dTG5dXE1kU2mpmL9BNnraffckLU.png","c":"JP"},{"n":"TOHO","logo":"/fRSWWjquvzcHjACbtF53utZFIll.png","c":"JP"},{"n":"Story","logo":"/cjmwexOzetWZa8QKy447NMrM6MG.png","c":"JP"},{"n":"KADOKAWA","logo":"/tWxRSaKmRJNTcmtlXsmn5R4KOSU.png","c":"JP"}],"countries":["JP"],"langs":["Japanese"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"JP","d":"2019-10-11"},{"c":"SG","d":"2019-12-12"},{"c":"VN","d":"2020-01-10"},{"c":"ID","d":"2020-03-11"},{"c":"DE","d":"2020-05-08"},{"c":"RU","d":"2020-09-10"},{"c":"IT","d":"2020-11-19"},{"c":"ES","d":"2021-09-03"},{"c":"BR","d":"2024-10-08"},{"c":"GB","d":"2026-09-28"}],"dir":["Tatsuyuki Nagai"],"prod":["Genki Kawamura","Narumi Odagiri","Shunsuke Saitou","Hiroyuki Shimizu","Noriko Ozaki"],"wri":["Mari Okada"],"mus":["Masaru Yokoyama"],"dop":["Hiroyuki Moriyama"],"cast":[{"n":"Shion Wakayama","ch":"Aoi Aioi (voice)","p":"/b697ggFreuliEfl4TjLgxhJCQXr.jpg"},{"n":"Ryo Yoshizawa","ch":"Shinnosuke Kanamuro / Shinno (voice)","p":"/1FJI3Vw8rsTxG03ZObbTAvn380a.jpg"},{"n":"Riho Yoshioka","ch":"Akane Aioi (voice)","p":"/b8DoAyEouFQJt15EtAl9ASKiJP9.jpg"},{"n":"Ken Matsudaira","ch":"Dankichi Ni